                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Aspire/releases/tag/v9.7.1"&gt;v9.7.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;Minor release for the Aspire Community Toolkit - we've bumped to Aspire 9.4.1, which is the currently supported release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Added some new APIs to the SurrealDB hosting integration for init files and creation scripts. Please note - these are considered experimental as they are inconsistent in having tests pass, so we're not ready to call them production stable.&lt;/p&gt;
